Alembic migrations for the Board Factory web application.

Revision ``0001_baseline`` is an empty parent for the chain; schema changes live
in ``0002_`` onward. Revisions are maintained by hand (``target_metadata`` is
unset in ``env.py``).

Operational commands (run inside the **board-factory** container, ``cd`` to
``/repo/app`` so ``alembic.ini`` resolves):

    alembic upgrade head            # apply outstanding migrations
    alembic current                 # show the DB's current revision
    alembic revision -m "what"      # add a new migration file (edit upgrade/downgrade)
    alembic downgrade -1            # roll back one revision
